# LAP68 UI Design

Derived from awesome-cursorrules Toss-style + project redesign brief.

## Direction

- Quiet, high-trust cashflow product UI. Clear hierarchy, generous spacing, minimal ornament.
- One primary accent (charcoal / near-black). Semantic soft green/red only for thu/chi status.
- No decorative gradients, neon glow, glassmorphism, or competing accent rainbows.
- Prefer semantic tokens (`bg-background`, `text-muted-foreground`, `border-border`) over raw zinc/slate utilities.

## Surfaces

- Canvas: warm bone off-white. Cards: white with `1px` border, radius 8–12px.
- Shadows ultra-diffuse or none. Never heavy `shadow-xl` on cards.
- No nested cards. No glow rings on active nav.

## Typography

- Sans geometric with character (Outfit). Metrics use `tabular-nums` / mono.
- Page titles: semibold sentence case — not italic uppercase shout.
- Never pure `#000` text; use off-black foreground.

## Interaction

- Hover: subtle border/bg shift. Active: `scale(0.98)`.
- Focus rings visible. Respect `prefers-reduced-motion`.
- Loading: skeleton shapes matching layout, not only spinners.
